{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Descending to the\u00a0ocean floor, Riley, a salvage engineer, is hoping to score a massive payday. Her team has discovered a forgotten distress signal coming from an abandoned navy research station at the bottom of the Antarctic ocean. If she can manage to get inside and release the reactor core's emergency ejection system, they'll be set for life!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In CRUSH DEPTH, you will experience atmospheric, retro-inspired horror on an ocean floor military base. You will solve puzzles, try to survive dangerous environments, and explore a hand-crafted world.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3938760/extras/7fb704a439dc6d0f333d90b5f30d28b7.poster.avif?t=1759463543\" width=1170 height=640 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3938760/extras/7fb704a439dc6d0f333d90b5f30d28b7.webm?t=1759463543\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3938760/extras/7fb704a439dc6d0f333d90b5f30d28b7.mp4?t=1759463543\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You'll use your salvager's wits to reroute power from damaged station systems to unlock your path forward, outwit the dangers of Eclipse station, and unravel the mysterious fate of the crew.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3938760/extras/8336a26833a119ba6444cde4588bede6.poster.avif?t=1759463543\" width=1170 height=640 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3938760/extras/8336a26833a119ba6444cde4588bede6.webm?t=1759463543\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3938760/extras/8336a26833a119ba6444cde4588bede6.mp4?t=1759463543\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Scour Eclipse station to discover logs left behind by the station's crew. Knowledge they collected may help you to survive!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3938760?t=1759463543","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3938760?t=1759463543","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3938760/b4b3fd24632c814435c2217ccfb0a97817de5917/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1759463543","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3938760/b4b3fd24632c814435c2217ccfb0a97817de5917/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1759463543","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Steam Achievements","id":22},{"description":"Full controller support","id":28},{"description":"Custom Volume Controls","id":68},{"description":"Stereo Sound","id":69},{"description":"Steam Cloud","id":23},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[5],"notes":"CRUSH DEPTH includes retro-inspired graphic depictions of gore. There are dead bodies and pieces of dead bodies present throughout the game. If you are killed in the game, your vision fills with blood."},"controller_support":"full","detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Descending to the\u00a0ocean floor, Riley, a salvage engineer, is hoping to score a massive payday. Her team has discovered a forgotten distress signal coming from an abandoned navy research station at the bottom of the Antarctic ocean. If she can manage to get inside and release the reactor core's emergency ejection system, they'll be set for life!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In CRUSH DEPTH, you will experience atmospheric, retro-inspired horror on an ocean floor military base. You will solve puzzles, try to survive dangerous environments, and explore a hand-crafted world.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3938760/extras/7fb704a439dc6d0f333d90b5f30d28b7.poster.avif?t=1759463543\" width=1170 height=640 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3938760/extras/7fb704a439dc6d0f333d90b5f30d28b7.webm?t=1759463543\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3938760/extras/7fb704a439dc6d0f333d90b5f30d28b7.mp4?t=1759463543\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You'll use your salvager's wits to reroute power from damaged station systems to unlock your path forward, outwit the dangers of Eclipse station, and unravel the mysterious fate of the crew.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3938760/extras/8336a26833a119ba6444cde4588bede6.poster.avif?t=1759463543\" width=1170 height=640 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3938760/extras/8336a26833a119ba6444cde4588bede6.webm?t=1759463543\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3938760/extras/8336a26833a119ba6444cde4588bede6.mp4?t=1759463543\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragra